# HelloCs headless: HaxeUI on Avalonia with no window, served by drive.cs. tools/selftest-cs.mjs headless
# builds and launches it: dotnet bin/hello-cs-headless/bin/Debug/net10.0/HelloCs.dll
# -cp src instead of -lib heaps-drive, so it builds this checkout whichever one haxelib points at.
-cp src
-cp examples
-lib haxeui-core
-lib haxeui-cs
-D haxeui_cs_headless
-D haxeui_cs_drive
-D drive
-main HelloCs
-cs bin/hello-cs-headless
-w -WAll
